A||N||13||FieroJoe||"HID" Xenon Bulb Conv Kit on ebay||||1||
Z||000000||FieroJoe||06-02-2001||10:56 PM||||Ran across this just now on ebay, sounds like a good deal.  All the other H4 bulb conv. kits I've seen are much more expensive than this, what do you all think?  Anybody have this particular kit?  Is it worth the $40?<BR> <A HREF="http://cgi.ebay.com/ebaymotors/aw-cgi/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&item=591895527" TARGET=_blank>http://cgi.ebay.com/ebaymotors/aw-cgi/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&item=591895527</A> <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/joesig_1.jpg"> <BR>'87 Coupe 5spd.<BR>AIM:FieroJoe87||||reg||1
